l": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CKPWnbEsfI8/maxresdefault.jpg", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": -1, "id": "44", "resolution": "1920x1080"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/CKPWnbEsfI8/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "45"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CKPWnbEsfI8/maxresdefault.jpg", "description": "On February 07, 2023, Hochiminh city, many victims of the Tam An Dau Tu (Investment at ease) of Manulife Vietnam, came to complain and denounce violations in the insurance business law.\nTam An Dau Tu (Investment at ease) is a life insurance product disguised as a profitable investment, saving with high interest, etc., which was advised and advertised by Manulife Vietnam insurance agents.\nThis package is an exclusive package for SCB bank customers, cooperated with Manulife, so it comes with Manulife's Health Insurance package.\nthe average interest rate is 9.5%/year, the lowest is 8.7%/year. The time to participate in this investment package is 5 years, after 5 years, you can withdraw all principal and interest (interest rate is always above 9.5%/year as above interest advice).\nbecause the life insurance contract is introduced as a gift. The bonus comes with this high-interest investment package, so we sign the contract without thinking and considering much.\nWith those covert and attractive advertising from Manulife, as well as the trust in SCB bank, we have agreed to participate in this high-interest savings investment package,\nManulife Vietnam is always proud of its 23-year history as a life insurance company from CANADA, who would have thought that they could bet their profound reputation to deceive Vietnamese people.\nWe went to Manulife Vietnam headquarters at 75 Hoang Van Thai, Tan Phu Ward, District 7, City. HCM for clarification. At this time, we really discovered that SCB and Manulife employees had misinterpreted the concept,\nThe amount paid was not a savings deposit, but actually to participate in life insurance, the life insurance gift was advertised as a bonus, in fact a life insurance purchase and sale contract.\nThat's when we found out that we were mistaken, tricked into participating in life insurance involuntarily. The purpose of participating in the initial package was to save and invest with high interest rates, but now it has become a life insurance contract with no interest and still owes this life insurance premium.\nAlthough there is clear photographic evidence, Manulife Vietnam surprised the Vietnamese more with their mind-blowing handling progress\nconstant gloss over and deceiving, blaming the SCB bank. \nwhile SCB is the exclusive cooperation partner of Manulife Vietnam in the distribution of life insurance products through banking channels.\nThe way to organize the sale of life insurance with a sophisticated and systematic method, Manulife's attitude to resolve complaints is to avoid, ignore, deny all responsibility, lead and invisibly force all victims to comply with life insurance signed *involuntarily* contract\nThese actions completely go against the core values that Manulife has set forth\n\"- Systematic and sophisticated concept-swapping trick\n- Declaring false information on insurance documents\n- Disinterest and ignoring\n- Deliberately evading, prolonging time\n- Leading and invisibly forcing the victim to continue participating in the signed life insurance policy\"\n\"- Manulife's attitude to handling complaints is to deny responsibility, not to settle\n- Manulife's attitude to handling complaints is very unscrupulous\n- Manulife's attitude of handling complaints is disrespectful and coercive\"\nAlthough many journalists have reported on violations of Manulife's insurance business law\nACTS NUMB AND PLAY DUMB are what Manulife's Vietnam does\n\n#BoycottManulife#ManulifeVietnam #ManulifeIsTheWorst  #TẩyChayManulife #MakingSureYoureUnhappySince1887 #LifeInsurrance #LifeInsurranceMatters #LifeInsurrancePolicies #Manulife #Canada", "channel_id": "UCuVsPqc_W4m